<title>UK: Europe VGO - interest wanes for high sulphur.</title>
<headline>Europe VGO - interest wanes for high sulphur.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>bid/ask	 prev bid/ask</p>
<p> Low sulphur cargoes fob NWE	  151/152	  152/153</p>
<p> High sulphur cargoes fob NWE	 150/153	  148/150</p>
<p> High sulphur barges fob ARA	  152/154	  150/151</p>
<p> Formula quotation fob Med	     08/12	    08/12</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>European vacuum gas oil was slow on Wednesday. Traders said there was little interest in high sulphur VGO now that gasoline premiums have eased.</p>
<p>A high sulphur barge was hear done today at $154 fob ARA.  </p>
<p>Low sulphur barges, which were talked up around $155 fob NWE earlier in the week, were assessed a touch easier as crude slipped.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 8980</p>
